<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA- to Ontario's 30 bln yen samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA- to Ontario's 30 bln yen samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned an AA- rating to the province of Ontario's 30 billion yen worth of 3.25 percent yen/U.S. dollar dual currency bonds due July 17, 2001.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
